    "text": "Equation of the plane through the line of intersection of given <math><mn>2</mn></math> planes is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∵</mo></math> it is perpendicular to <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />On comparing&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math>",
